  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project for Advancement of the ICT-based National Park Climate Change monitoring Capacity</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Analysis of work process, establishment of smart sensor system, establishment of Integrated monitoring system activity, development of mobile monitoring application, installation of real-time situation room, and related equipment,Capacity building for high-level officers and managers, Park Rangers, ICT-based monitoring system operators, and data utilization,Formation of civic activists, awareness-raising of local communities, - Monitoring survey target site selection, Development of monitoring manuals, provision of monitoring equipment, monitoring activity performance management</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced capacity for climate change monitoring in National Parks through expansion of infrastructure and human resource and improvement of operative system&#xbb3c;&#xc801;/&#xc778;&#xc801;&#xae30;&#xbc18; &#xd655;&#xcda9; &#xbc0f; &#xd65c;&#xb3d9;&#xccb4;&#xacc4; &#xac1c;&#xc120;&#xc744; &#xd1b5;&#xd55c; &#xad6d;&#xb9bd;&#xacf5;&#xc6d0; &#xae30;&#xd6c4;&#xbcc0;&#xd654; &#xbaa8;&#xb2c8;&#xd130;&#xb9c1; &#xc5ed;&#xb7c9; &#xace0;&#xb3c4;&#xd654;</narrative>
  </description>
